  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">The Warm Side of the Cape</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3803 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-ma tag-meet-the-artist tag-red-sox tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3803\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/june-2-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"320\" height=\"220\" alt=\"Red Sox Wive’s Cookbook: Crowding The Plate. Cover image by Elaine Felos Ostrander\" src=\"/media/archive/d04c577147f4d2aec8136e30bcd6cd7ddeb19707992fbd7089c2e31f2e57770b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/june-2-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">June 2 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-18T03:19:53-04:00\" title=\"Friday, May 18, 2018, 3:19 am\">May 18, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet an artist with a sports interest and specialty in painting teams such as the Boston Red Sox that capture the excitement of their events. Elaine Felos Ostrander will do a <a href=\"/news/june-2-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3180 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists tag-harwich-port tag-larry-folding tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3180\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/full-house-at-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists\" src=\"/media/archive/3f3eb0d941611dc4a31772727e888434060a5c8e1ceda43030fffda6ec0f2af5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/full-house-at-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Full House at Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-16T16:14:04-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, July 16, 2017, 4:14 pm\">July 16, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Award winning Harwich Artist, Larry Folding, demonstrates for a full house at Meet The Artist Completing a half sheet painting from start to finish using wet into wet and wet <a href=\"/news/full-house-at-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3170 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events category-meet-the-artist category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-hydrangea-festival tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-garden-club tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3170\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/gardens-by-the-sea-the-cape-cod-hydrangea-festival/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"657\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Doris Mee at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" src=\"/media/archive/66ad518952281ae84f99eca7d6aed79184030eae6cea3f4ff0a264b2a3baaf05.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/gardens-by-the-sea-the-cape-cod-hydrangea-festival/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Gardens By The Sea – The Cape Cod Hydrangea Festival</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-14T00:56:57-04:00\" title=\"Friday, July 14, 2017, 12:56 am\">July 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Sponsored by the Cape Cod Chamber of Commerce, The Cape Cod Hydrangea Festival is an annual celebration of the region’s blue, pink, and white signature flowers! All garden tour proceeds <a href=\"/news/gardens-by-the-sea-the-cape-cod-hydrangea-festival/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3121 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-plein-air category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-lydia-bell tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3121\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/july-8-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Guild member, Lydia Bell, painting en plein air. ©The Guild of Harwich Artists\" src=\"/media/archive/42fb9abaeffeb7bfc882f8cf9ef453aba65091f1d37ebde07418c331bac35a40.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/july-8-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">July 8 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-02T20:49:10-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, July 2, 2017, 8:49 pm\">July 2, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet the Artist, Lydia Bell, at The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists on July 8, from 2 to 4 pm. Looking for more ways to enjoy your <a href=\"/news/july-8-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2923 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-2923\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/celebrate-with-us-july-1-and-2/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"502\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of a girl in an american flag dress.\" src=\"/media/archive/7f0b70eb08b6ac1d6e462e8315b2d509dbe333bfa4a432c4c22d2577d6c6931e.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/celebrate-with-us-july-1-and-2/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Celebrate The Art Gallery’s 10th Anniversary July 1 and 2</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-06-24T23:49:22-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 24, 2017, 11:49 pm\">June 24, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists is officially celebrating the Tenth Year of their Art Gallery in Harwich Port, at 551 Route 28, right across from the Chamber of Commerce. The <a href=\"/news/celebrate-with-us-july-1-and-2/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\